    <briefdescription>
<para>Extension for data buffering. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides an extension for a data buffer. It can be used to populate a generic payloads data pointer with automatic memory management as the extension is deleted once the payload is deleted or returned to the memory manager.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This extension is unmanaged and must be freed manually. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
